---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="Privacy policy of Levion Materials.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="main">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Last updated: 2026-08-06</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Controller</h2>
        <p>
          Levion Materials GmbH<br />
          Street Address<br />
          City, Germany<br />
          E-Mail: <a href="mailto:info@levion-materials.com">info@levion-materials.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Data collected when visiting this website</h2>
        <p>
          When you visit this website, our server automatically collects certain technical data
          transmitted by your browser: IP address, date and time of access, pages visited, browser
          type and version, operating system, and referrer URL. This data is processed on the basis
          of Art. 6 para. 1 lit. f GDPR (legitimate interest) to ensure the security and stability
          of our web infrastructure. Log files are deleted after 30 days.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Contact form</h2>
        <p>
          If you contact us via the contact form, the data you submit (name, email address, message)
          will be stored and used solely to process your inquiry. Legal basis: Art. 6 para. 1 lit. b
          GDPR. Data is not passed on to third parties without your consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Newsletter</h2>
        <p>
          If you subscribe to our newsletter, we process your email address to send you updates.
          Legal basis: Art. 6 para. 1 lit. a GDPR (consent). You may unsubscribe at any time using
          the link in each newsletter.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request access to your personal data (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request rectification of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request erasure of your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Object to processing (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Request data portability (Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
          <li>Lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Contact: <a href="mailto:info@levion-materials.com">info@levion-materials.com</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .main { padding-top: 8rem; padding-bottom: 6rem; min-height: 80vh; }
  .container { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  section { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: .75rem; padding-bottom: .5rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  p { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
  ul { color: var(--text-muted); margin: .5rem 0 1rem 1.5rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  li { margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }
  a:hover { opacity: .75; }
</style>
